<mxCell id="physical-sc100" value="&lt;b&gt;MDF-101&lt;/b&gt; · racks R01 and R02 on separate circuits, each with its own UPS. Firewall, core and gateway pairs are split across the two racks, so one rack's power can fail.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fiber&lt;/b&gt; · 12-strand OS2 to IDF-A, B and D; 12-strand OM4 to IDF-C (under 300 m). Four strands (two pairs) in use per closet, the rest spare." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="physical-L7">
<mxGeometry x="1350" y="860" width="560" height="112" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
