<mxCell id="hardware-sc354" value="&lt;b&gt;Why this sheet exists&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every new AP, camera and door strike draws PoE. Before summer installs, check the closet here first: the budget is the switch's, the drawn power is the rated draw of what is plugged in, kept by hand. Amber means the closet can't lose a member." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#F7FAFD;strokeColor=#E8EEF6;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Inter;" vertex="1" parent="hardware-L3">
